WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.585
Infinity-harmonic gradients, continuous.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.010
Aronsson's example, sliced along one axis. Its gradient

3
00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:08.469
behaves like a cube root near zero.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.035
A failure would rescale into a solution that a Liouville theorem forbids.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.523
Claimed: Hölder gradients in every dimension, three up.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.015
No Lean proof.
